<config.toml>: warning: [model] name gpt-5.5 is a model of OpenAI, but [model] provider is anthropic-api, so a turn that does not name its own model fails without a login to OpenAI; log in to OpenAI with efr login openai or efr login openai-api, set [model] name to a model of anthropic-api, or remove it
